# Regression: create three timers, delete two, idle past the old death
# window, then select the survivor. Built to reproduce creation and
# selection bugs; run it again after any change to window lifetime,
# popup teardown, or the app timer.
#
#   tools/screenshots.sh -p emery tools/scenes/delete-then-select.scene
#
# Pass: no "App fault" and no "does not exist" in <out>/logs.txt, and the
# final shot is a detail view.
note create timer A (3s)
press select
press select
press up 3
press select
wait 1
press back
wait 1
note create timer B (5s) from the + row
press up
press select        # open picker
press select        # hours -> minutes
press select        # minutes -> seconds
press up 5
press select        # confirm
wait 1
press back
wait 1
note create timer C (6s)
press up
press select        # open picker
press select        # hours -> minutes
press select        # minutes -> seconds
press up 6
press select        # confirm
wait 1
press back
wait 1
shot three-timers
note delete B: DOWN arms, UP confirms (SELECT is ignored while armed)
press select
wait 1
press down
wait 1
press up
shot deleted-popup
wait 5
shot popup-closed
note delete C
press select
wait 1
press down
wait 1
press up
wait 5
shot two-deleted
note idle past the old ~35s death window, then select the survivor
wait 30
shot after-idle
press select
wait 2
shot reopened
